sequenceDiagram
    participant WMA as Warehouse Management mobile app
    participant Provider as Provider app
    participant HW as Hardware

    WMA->>Provider: com.microsoft.aierpmobile.FORM_DATA<br/>Send the current form
    Provider->>HW: Present form, controls, and instructions
    HW-->>Provider: Worker input or action
    alt Apply control changes and submit the form
        Provider->>WMA: com.microsoft.aierpmobile.CONTROL_CHANGES
    else Submit the form without changing controls
        Provider->>WMA: com.microsoft.aierpmobile.SUBMIT_FORM
    else Close the current notification or instruction
        Provider->>WMA: com.microsoft.aierpmobile.CLOSE_NOTIFICATION
    end